# Starter pipeline the compose `tenzir` profile bind-mounts (./tenzir/pipeline.tql).
/tenzir/
/tenzir/pipeline.tql
# NAN-3807/NAN-3853: the Tenzir guide README and install.sh point users at, and
# the lean example pipelines install.sh seeds .nano-tenzir/pipeline.tql from
# (--tenzir and the default bucket drop). Without them the seed is silently
# skipped and the printed paths do not exist in the public checkout.
/tenzir/AGENTS.md
/tenzir/lean/***
